+  em-dashes, exempted BY NAME (the copy test exempts the same strings by
+  construction). A NEW const/fn carrying an em-dash fails the lint until it
+  is either made dash-free or explicitly added to SPEC_VERBATIM_OWNERS with
+  a provenance note - so implementer-authored copy can no longer hide in
+  the exempted module (N5).
